  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes.\n• Drain and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c45917498f8bf2dafd/step-6d682600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice capsicum and spring onion.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook corn and capsicum, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Tex-Mex spice blend (see ingredients) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. TIP: Cover the frying pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping out”.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c45917498f8bf2dafd/step-ce425410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. Season to taste.\n• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine slaw mix and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c45917498f8bf2dafd/step-90726620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir mild chipotle sauce through the veggie mince mixture until well combined.\n• Divide rice between bowls. Top with Southern plant-based mince and slaw.\n• Drizzle with dill & parsley mayonnaise.\n• Garnish with spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c45917498f8bf2dafd/step-6a00d830.jpg"
    }
  ]
